  "notes": "{戦闘|せんとう} specifically refers to armed fighting or military engagement.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {戦闘|せんとう}{機|き}: fighter aircraft\n- {戦闘|せんとう}{員|いん}: combatant\n- {戦闘|せんとう}{力|りょく}: fighting power, combat strength\n- {戦闘|せんとう}{態勢|たいせい}: combat readiness\n- {戦闘|せんとう}{地域|ちいき}: combat zone\n- {戦闘|せんとう}を{開始|かいし}する: to commence fighting\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {戦闘|せんとう}: combat, fighting (specific military engagement)\n- {戦争|せんそう}: war (broader, a state of armed conflict between nations)\n- {戦|たたか}い: battle, fight (more general, includes non-military conflicts)\n- {交戦|こうせん}: engagement, exchange of fire (formal military term)\n- {合戦|かっせん}: battle (historical, used for premodern battles)",
